WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
TattvaSwarm: sovereign personal AI swarm. Nebius x NVIDIA Global AI Hackathon 2026.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Honest degradation: with no key, TattvaSwarm reports the exact reason and never fabricates an answer.

3
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:34.000
With a key, the doctor verifies the backend live: 28 models, 5 NVIDIA/Nemotron.

4
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Everyday prompts route to the fast Nemotron tier (Nano on Token Factory).

5
00:00:47.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Reasoning prompts route to Nemotron Super.

6
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Persistent local memory: SQLite + FTS5, on your disk only. Nothing syncs anywhere.

7
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Logical swarm engine: 100,000 workers as compact state machines, verifiable checksum.

8
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Conductor: parallel workers -> verifier pass -> heavy-model synthesis, ~2.3k tokens.

9
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Live demo on GitHub Pages: deterministic router in the browser + live NVIDIA NIM calls.

10
00:01:52.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Sovereignty is a routing problem before it is a cryptography problem.
